<title>USA: First Pacific names O'Brien chairman.</title>
<headline>First Pacific names O'Brien chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Pacific Networks Inc said Tuesday it had named Paul O'Brien chairman, succeeding Craig Brunet, who resigned to pursue other business interests.</p>
<p>O'Brien has served as a director of First Pacific since October 1994 and formed O'Brien Group Inc, an investment consulting firm focused on information technology, First Pacific said.</p>
<p>First Pacific develop products for telephone, data and energy management communications.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
